Aptura is built on open-source libraries. Every library on the release runtime
classpath is covered below: the build reads the resolved dependency graph and
NoticeCoverageTest fails when a library group is not named in a "Maven groups"
line (or an entry names one that is no longer there). Test-only libraries are
marked.

