  restrict modification or reverse engineering, and gradle/ffmpeg-bundle.properties
  names the bundle that a build links. The full licence text is in the app
  (Settings, Open-source licences) and in the release above.

AndroidX Media (Media3) FFmpeg audio extension, version 1.5.1
  Copyright The Android Open Source Project
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Five Java classes (FfmpegAudioRenderer, FfmpegAudioDecoder,
  FfmpegDecoderException, FfmpegLibrary and its package-info) are copied
  unmodified into app/src/main/java/androidx/media3/decoder/ffmpeg, and the
  JNI glue ffmpeg_jni.cc from the same tag joins them to the FFmpeg libraries.
  Source: https://github.com/androidx/media
  The extension decodes audio only. Aptura ships no software video decoder
  (ADR-010).

